### BANK: ejemplo didáctico en entorno vacío; revisar y copiar IDs reales antes de continuar.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@household = REEMPLAZA_HOGAR
@cash = REEMPLAZA_CUENTA_PHYSICAL
@digital = REEMPLAZA_CUENTA_DIGITAL
@central = REEMPLAZA_SOBRE_CENTRAL
@sams = REEMPLAZA_SOBRE_SAMS
@period = REEMPLAZA_PERIODO
@source = REEMPLAZA_FUENTE

### 1. Crear hogar; el usuario autenticado queda OWNER
POST {{base}}/households
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Familia","displayName":"Olda"}

### 2. Crear cuenta física; copiar id a cash
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/accounts
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Efectivo familiar","type":"PHYSICAL"}

### 3. Crear cuenta digital; copiar id a digital
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/accounts
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Banco","type":"DIGITAL"}

### 4. Crear fuente, sin depósito; copiar id a source
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/income-sources
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Nómina","type":"PAYROLL","accountId":"{{digital}}","expectedAmount":21000.00}

### 5. Crear Central; copiar id a central
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/envelopes
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Central de Abastos","accountId":"{{cash}}","type":"SPENDING","category":"Alimentación"}

### 6. Crear Sam's; copiar id a sams
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/envelopes
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Sam's","accountId":"{{cash}}","type":"SAVINGS","category":"Alimentación"}

### 7. Planificar, sin reservas automáticas
PUT {{base}}/households/{{household}}/budget-template
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedIncome":21000.00,"allocations":[{"envelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":4500.00},{"envelopeId":"{{sams}}","amount":1000.00}]}

### 8. Crear quincena OPEN; copiar id a period
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/budget-periods
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"startDate":"2026-11-15","endDate":"2026-11-30","open":true}

### 9. Registrar sólo si ya existen 1080 reales en efectivo y aún no fueron contabilizados
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/opening-balances
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Idempotency-Key: demo-opening-cash-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"{{cash}}","amount":1080.00,"description":"Saldo real inicial"}

### 10. Apartar Central; cuenta permanece 1080
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/allocations
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Idempotency-Key: demo-allocate-central-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","envelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":80.00,"description":"Apartado Central"}

### 11. Apartar Sam's; cuenta permanece 1080
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/allocations
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Idempotency-Key: demo-allocate-sams-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","envelopeId":"{{sams}}","amount":1000.00,"description":"Apartado Sam's"}

### 12. Preview: faltante 70, sin escritura
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/expenses/preview
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","targetEnvelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":150.00,"description":"Carne"}

### 13. Un gasto: cuenta 930, Central 0 y Sam's 930. Repetir conserva respuesta y saldos.
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/expenses
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Idempotency-Key: demo-expense-carne-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","targetEnvelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":150.00,"description":"Carne","fundingSources":[{"envelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":80.00},{"envelopeId":"{{sams}}","amount":70.00}]}

### 14. Registrar nómina nueva únicamente si realmente ingresó, sin repetir dinero inicial
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/incomes
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Idempotency-Key: demo-income-payroll-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","accountId":"{{digital}}","incomeSourceId":"{{source}}","amount":21000.00,"description":"Nómina real"}

### 15. Consultar saldos oficiales
GET {{base}}/households/{{household}}/dashboard
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
